## PluginSelector.razor

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Components.Shared`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`
**Location**: `Components/Shared/PluginSelector.razor` + `PluginSelector.razor.cs`

### Purpose
Blazor shared component that displays checkboxes for activating/deactivating `IAssistantPlugin` instances. Plugins are filtered by the current chat's assistant mode. Required plugins are disabled (cannot be unchecked).

### Component Markup
```razor
<div class="mb-3">
    <label class="form-label">Activated Features</label>
    <div class="p-2">
        @foreach (var item in _models)
        {
            <div class="form-check">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" 
                    @bind="item.Selected" @bind:after="PopulateChat" 
                    disabled="@item.Required">
                <label class="form-check-label">
                    @item.Plugin.Title
                </label>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</div>
```

### Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `Chat` | `ChatConfiguration` | Yes | The current chat configuration whose `PluginIds` will be updated |

### Code-Behind

```csharp
public partial class PluginSelector
{
    [Inject] private IServiceProvider _services { get; set; } = default!;
    [Parameter] [EditorRequired] public ChatConfiguration Chat { get; set; }

    private IEnumerable<PluginSelect> _models = default!;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        var plugins = _services.GetServices<IAssistantPlugin>()
            .Where(x => x.Modes.Length == 0 || x.Modes.Contains(Chat.AssistantModeId));
        _models = plugins.Select(x => new PluginSelect(x)).ToList();

        if (!Chat.PluginIds.Any())
            foreach (var item in _models)
                item.Selected = true;
        else
        {
            foreach (var item in _models)
                item.Selected = item.Required || Chat.PluginIds.Any(x => x == item.Plugin.Id);
        }
    }

    private void PopulateChat()
    {
        var ids = _models.Where(x => x.Selected || x.Required).Select(x => x.Id);
        Chat.PluginIds = ids.ToList();
    }
}

internal record PluginSelect(IAssistantPlugin Plugin)
{
    public bool Selected { get; set; }
    public bool Required => Plugin.Required;
    public string Id => Plugin.Id;
}
```

### Behavior

1. **Initialization** (`OnInitialized`):
   - Resolves all `IAssistantPlugin` services from DI
   - Filters plugins by mode compatibility: `x.Modes.Length == 0 || x.Modes.Contains(Chat.AssistantModeId)`
   - If `Chat.PluginIds` is empty, all plugins are selected by default
   - Otherwise, selects plugins matching `Chat.PluginIds` plus required plugins

2. **Selection Change** (`@bind:after="PopulateChat"`):
   - Updates `Chat.PluginIds` with IDs of all selected (or required) plugins

### Plugin Filtering
- Plugins with `Modes.Length == 0` are mode-agnostic (available in all modes)
- Plugins with specific mode IDs are only shown when `Chat.AssistantModeId` matches
- Required plugins (`Plugin.Required == true`) are always selected and disabled

### Internal Model

```csharp
internal record PluginSelect(IAssistantPlugin Plugin)
{
    public bool Selected { get; set; }
    public bool Required => Plugin.Required;
    public string Id => Plugin.Id;
}
```

### Dependencies
- `IAssistantPlugin` - Plugin contract
- `ChatConfiguration` - Chat configuration model

